{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264M7QbUsiWa1794873109.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國強生宣布以最多逾33億美元，收購創新藥企業Ollin Biosciences。交易代價包括優先付款22億美元，以及最多11.25億美元監管與里程碑款項，預計明年年底前完成交易。</p><p></p><p>Ollin主要研發治療眼疾藥物，當中正處於治療濕性老年黃斑部病變及糖尿病黃斑水腫的第三期臨床開發階段。強生表示，有關產品具潛力提供更強及更持久的疾病控制。</p><p></p><p>同時，強生亦獲黑石集團提供最多7.5億美元，用於資助藥物第三期臨床開發。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.280379+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T23:49:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:46.913385+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:49.438390+00:00","content_hash":"fc12aa23632aea559c74f83fe638937bd52665e22030700054dc67710b8bbb42","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T00:45:24.280379+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}